      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8746096::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Partial replacement of Hf by Al can avoid sacrificing the baseline room- and high-temperature yield strengths.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8658560::webcard",
        "PMC8746096::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al-modified alloy will retain a primary disordered BCC or B2 solid-solution matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al-modified alloy will retain lattice distortion similar to that of the baseline.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dislocation-slip behavior will remain similar after Al substitution.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10453588::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al has a lower atomic weight than Hf.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preservation of solid-solution and dislocation-mediated strengthening will preserve yield strength after Al substitution.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10453588::webcard",
        "PMC8746096::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified alloy will have approximately 15% lower density than the as-cast baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
